 "note": "Design round 9, feature stale (Limits that are not live), the option chosen: stale-tilde. rows are copied from the design's stale.json, verbatim (each row is the full HUD of build.cjs: hud4.js MIX.render on the situation's state with the fable-boss option, colour style, left-aligned, with the 1.0.0 frame; the hearts line's 5-hour % and hearts, and the weekly's drumsticks and % with col 62, redrawn by the option). situations are the design's inputs: state is the engine's state, ctx.stale which windows are last-known (from limits.json, not sent live). Kamal's picks (picks-r9.json): stale-tilde.",
